bootDll: the boot sound group and the title music on MPT_PC
Applied in order by runtimes/gc_wii/mp4/CMakeLists.txt with `git apply`.

Party Board leaves these blocks to __MWERKS__ ("TODO PC"), so the boot sound effects (msm group 0)
and the title music (stream 20) were missing. We build msm, so the console code runs as written;
msmSysLoadGroup takes two arguments, as in patch 0007. The opening movie block stays as Party Board
has it until THPSimple reads the big-endian THP headers (see docs/titles/mp4.md, M2).

